A||||14||RZURCTN||Yet Another Taillight Mod!||||10||
Z||000000||RZURCTN||02-11-2000||04:28 PM||||Not to steal any of Monkeymans thunder, but just for the hell of it, I took apart a spare set of tail lights and did the following:  <P>I used your standard black type electrical tape to mask off the top and bottom of the inside lenses (not the clear cover!) and made the lights about 2 inches wide.  This invlolved very little effort, cost very little money and took very little time. (Those are the kind of mods I really like!! <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">)  If you decide you don't like it, don't want it, or just plain get tired of it and want to do something else, take it apart and peel off the tape!  <P>I just thought that I'd throw that out there for those of us who have to have a super-cool Fiero but don't have all that really-super-cool cash to do it with!  Then again, if you had all that cash....nevermind!  Take it for what it's worth and run with it!        ||||reg||10
Z||000001||Monkeyman||02-11-2000||05:19 PM||||My tail light kit doesn't require lots of $$.  They are $17US including shipping to the lower 48.  Add a few dollars for Alaska, Hawaii and Canada.  As for our Dutch members, if you're interested, email me.  We can work something out.||||reg||1
Z||000002||Sage||02-11-2000||06:07 PM||||Sounds nifty and thrifty, (for us pofoke), would like to see how it looks. <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">||||reg||14
Z||000003||RZURCTN||02-11-2000||11:50 PM||||I wasn't implying that you are price gouging Monkeyman! <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">  Your vinyl stickers are really cool.  If I happened to have $17 on me I might go for a set that reads something like, "MARINES", or "USMC"!  I did have some elect. tape laying around and thought "Why not?!"  I also figured that most guys would have some elect. tape in their tool box or in that kitchen drawer that's always piled full of crap!  So doing the mod shouldn't cost anything out of pocket.  But if you want true originality, give Monkeyman a call and purchase a set of his decals!!!||||reg||1
Z||000004||GT Bastard||02-12-2000||09:45 PM||||Something about putting electrical tape on my tail-lights is disturbing....  ;o)||||reg||1
