Z||000009||Formula||02-13-2000||12:13 PM||||Monkeyman,<P>Since you do seem to know the most about taillight mods I would like to get your input.<P>Do you take the black plastic out of the back and stick the vinyl there?<P>If so, would it be possible to buy 5% window tint and tint the tailight to make a cool looking blackout efect?  And it would be legal since the light would shine through like normal.||||reg||1
